00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Rock Star is a music, drama, comedy film directed by Stephen Herek.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
A wannabe rock star who fronts a Pennsylvania-based tribute band is
devastated when his bandmates kick him out of the group he founded.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Things begin to look up for Izzy when he is asked to join Steel Dragon,
the heavy metal rockers he had been imitating for so long.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
This film is loosely based on the true story of the band Judas Priest.

6
